Feature: Item

  Background:
    Given I Visit "/"

  @fixme
  Scenario: Marking todos as complete
    Given I Add "buy some cheese"
    And I Add "feed the cat"
    When I Tick the Todo "buy some cheese"
    Then the Checkbox "Toggle Todo" Within the Todo "buy some cheese" should be Checked
    But the Checkbox "Toggle Todo" Within the Todo "feed the cat" should Not be Checked
    When I Tick the Todo "feed the cat"
    Then the Checkbox "Toggle Todo" Within the Todo "feed the cat" should be Checked

  @fixme
  Scenario: Un-marking a todo
    Given I Add "buy some cheese"
    And I Add "feed the cat"
    When I Tick the Todo "buy some cheese"
    And I Untick the Todo "buy some cheese"
    Then the Checkbox "Toggle Todo" Within the Todo "buy some cheese" should Not be Checked
    And I should See "2 items left"

  @fixme
  Scenario: Editing a todo
    Given I Add "buy some cheese"
    And I Add "feed the cat"
    And I Add "book a doctors appointment"
    When I Double-click the Todo "feed the cat"
    Then the Editor should have the Value "feed the cat"
    When I Fill the Editor with "buy some sausages"
    And I Press "Enter" on the Editor
    Then I should See "buy some sausages"
    But I should Not See "feed the cat"
